	"title" "意图乱流 Intent Chaos"
	"description" "[h1]Intent Chaos 意图乱流[/h1]\nMonster intents are no longer fixed loops — when a monster takes real HP damage from your direct attacks, it immediately rerolls its intent to a random different move from its entire move pool.\n\n[h2]Core Mechanics[/h2]\n[list]\n[*]A monster that loses HP to a [b]direct attack[/b] instantly rerolls its intent, and it is guaranteed to land on a different move\n[*]Passive damage from relics, potions, powers and end-of-turn effects does [b]not[/b] trigger rerolls\n[*]No trigger on fully blocked hits (no HP lost) or on kills\n[*]Random picks use the game's synchronized multiplayer RNG, so both clients stay in sync\n[/list]\n\n[h2]Boss Rules[/h2]\n[list]\n[*]All bosses reroll from their very first move\n[*][b]One exception: the Act 2 sandworm's opener[/b]\n[*][b]The Queen (Act 3) exception: her first three moves stay fixed[/b], then she joins the random pool\n[*]Every boss gains one extra move in its pool: [b]Curse Card[/b] — when rolled, it [b]permanently[/b] adds a curse card to your deck, and instantly shuffles a copy into your current draw pile\n[*]That move shows the purple summon icon on top of the monster's head; hover over it for details\n[/list]\n\n[h2]Compatibility[/h2]\n[list]\n[*]Pure code mod with zero dependencies — coexists with character mods, BaseLib, etc.\n[*]Self-adapts to game versions at runtime (minor updates need no maintenance; on a major rewrite the mod puts itself to sleep to protect your game — never crashes it)\n[*]Verified from 0.107.1 through 0.111.0, stable and beta\n[/list]\n\n\n\n[h1]意图乱流 Intent Chaos[/h1]\n怪物的意图不再是固定循环——受到你的直接攻击并真实掉血后，它会立刻从自己的全部招式池里随机换一个别的意图。\n\n[h2]核心机制[/h2]\n[list]\n[*]怪物被[b]直接攻击[/b]造成[b]真实掉血[/b] → 该怪物意图立刻重掷，且保证换成不同的招式\n[*]遗物、药水、能力牌、回合结束等[b]被动伤害不触发[/b]\n[*]被格挡完全挡下（不掉血）、怪物死亡：不触发\n[*]怪物随机选招使用联机同步 RNG，多人游戏下两端一致\n[/list]\n\n[h2]BOSS 规则[/h2]\n[list]\n[*]所有 boss 从第一招起就参与随机\n[*][b]一个例外：第二层沙虫的首回合[/b]\n[*][b]女王（第三层）特例：开场三招固定不变[/b]，之后才参与随机\n[*]boss 招式池额外含一招 [b]【塞诅咒牌】[/b]：被随机到时会[b]永久[/b]往你的卡组加一张诅咒牌——战斗结束也不会移除，同时立刻塞一张进本战抽牌堆\n[*]该招式头顶显示紫色召唤物图样，鼠标悬停可查看说明\n[/list]\n\n[h2]兼容性[/h2]\n[list]\n[*]纯代码 mod，无前置依赖，与角色 mod、BaseLib 等共存\n[*]运行时自适应游戏版本（小版本更新免维护；大改版会自动休眠保护游戏，不会崩溃）\n[*]已在 0.107.1 至 0.111.0 验证，稳定版与测试版通用\n[/list]"
	"changenote" "v0.3.2 第二层 boss 沙虫的首回合招式固定：那招【液态化沙地】是整场战斗里吞噬倒计时和 6 张慌乱逃离的唯一来源，本体状态机走过一次就再也回不到它。之前被随机换走后，它只能靠每回合约五分之一的摇号重新出现，约三分之一场次的沙虫整个吞噬机制一次都没发动；反过来被随机发到中盘又会把倒计时挂两遍——同一玩家身上两条独立倒计时。现在这一招既不随机进池也不会被换走，别的 boss 花样不受影响。The Act 2 sandworm keeps its turn-1 opener: the devour timer and its 6 Frantic Escape cards come from that single move, so it can no longer be rerolled away or handed out twice."
}
